<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆ανδρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		of places, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of men,
				populous,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				73
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				899
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					903.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Palaeph.
					38
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>many, numerous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέρσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					533
				</span></i>
			 (anap.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				693
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥβα νέων π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tim.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					194
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					21.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. συμβολή</span>
			<i>much</i> experience <i>of men,</i> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				172.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ π.</span> wife <i>of many husbands,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				72
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύανδρον, τό,</span>
			<i>prostitution,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.563
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυάνδριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
